        "inputs": {
          "note": "Check Point Gaia agent over the MCP Gateway (http://mcp-gateway:8080/mcp), scoped to the Gaia MCP server's 42 tools.\n\nMCP: Custom MCP node -> http://mcp-gateway:8080/mcp with Authorization \"Bearer {{$vars.MCP_GATEWAY_TOKEN}}\". builders-import keeps the Flowise variable MCP_GATEWAY_TOKEN (Variables page) in sync with .env.\n\nAvailable Actions: 42 tools selected. Refresh lists all 190 gateway tools; keep the selection at 128 or fewer.\n\nModel: lab-chat through LiteLLM (credential \"Lab Model (LiteLLM)\", Base Path http://litellm:4000/v1 under Additional Parameters). The Model Name list only knows OpenAI model names, so it can look empty: leave it, the agent still uses lab-chat."
